      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-28T19:37:40.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹93.03 (vs ₹26.92 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹93.03 (up from ₹26.92 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹36.6b (up 12% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹712.3m (up 246% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.9% (up from 0.6% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to stay flat during the next 2 years compared to a 11% growth forecast for the Auto Components industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 35% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 12% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
